    {
      "text": "City staff report and CEQAnet list the site as APNs 412-25-009 and 412-25-010 (2375 and 2395 S Bascom Ave), then occupied by Dry Creek Plaza: four commercial buildings totaling about 6,030 sq ft. The county parcel layer now shows APN 412-25-026 at 2375 S Bascom Ave.",
